Z||000006||Shaun41178||04-08-2000||01:29 AM||||Glad you liked my homepage.  Look for updates and new pages in the future as I get my aluminum block machined and assembled as well as installed.  Parts of my 3.2 and the costs of them will be posted on a new page.  Look for it in the near future.  Also pics of a turbo project that I would like to put on.  So far have the turbo and the knowledge but with my 3.2 project a bit short on funds to get it off the ground.  Perhaps next year or the end of this summer before it is on.<P>Eric from this board and I are planning on going to norwalk on April 21 which is a Fri.  It is the first test and tune of the season.  Sure would like to see more fieros out there.  Eric will have his 3.2 and I will have my nitrous Fiero there.  WEATHER permitting of course.  Norwalk is only like 40 minutes from Cleveland or so.  anyone else interested?<P>Shaun||||reg||1
